        """Return one tiny truthful row for plain ``plugin``.

        The root plugin command is still a usage-style dispatcher, but nearby
        plugin entry points already expose tiny trustworthy inventory state. Keep
        the no-arg command-bar row aligned with those neighbors so the top-level
        entry point says whether plugin support is unavailable or what broad
        inventory shape exists behind its subcommands.
        """

        row = self._prompt_command_row(insert)
